    {
      "id": "story_4452_p0_c1",
      "chunk_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "text": "先月、新しい中国語の先生が私を教えに来て、彼女のアプローチが非常に異なっていることを発見しました。",
      "text_en": "Last month, a new Chinese teacher came to teach me, and I found that her approach was very different.",
